TITLE:: Tuner
SUMMARY:: A user interface to help tune a hardware synth.
CATEGORIES:: Frontends
RELATED:: Classes/FxBank

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::Tuner:: provides a user interface to play an SC synth alongside a hardware synth, so that the hardware synth can be tuned.

The Tuner screen has the following controls:

TABLE::
## TELETYPE::Play:: button || Starts playing a sequence on the default SC synth and the selected hardware synth simultaneously.
## TELETYPE::Fx bank:: button || Opens the LINK::Classes/FxBank::, which may be necessary to connect synths to SC when the server starts.
## TELETYPE::SYNTH:: drop-down list || Allows the hardware synth to be chosen.
## TELETYPE::TEMPO:: knob || Allows the tempo of the sequence to be changed.
## TELETYPE::AMP:: knob || Allows the amplitude of the default SC synth to be changed in order to match the hardware synth.
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates an instance of TELETYPE::Tuner::. This also calls LINK::Classes/Setup#*server:: in order to ensure the LINK::Classes/Server:: is started.

PRIVATE:: init

EXAMPLES::

CODE::
// Show the Tuner
Tuner();
// That's it!
::
